{"v":4,"catch":"一個流行的謎題，您必須找出哪些單元格是黑色的，\n哪些是白色的。","desc":"在這個超級流行的謎題中，黑色空間和白色空間慢慢地融合在一起，展現出它們的真實形態。 “Nurikabe”是一個拼圖，您可以參考排列的數字來填充所有空格。 它受到從初學者到專家的廣泛玩家的歡迎。 看著黑色的空間像軟體動物一樣伸展開來，感覺很棒。\n\n選項菜單、手冊和其他文本有日語、英語、法語、德語、意大利語和西班牙語版本。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-12-08","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲","訓練","學習"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/71529cbd9149e55a6cf3dbc5e84808f8eeb5c2ae4e645fafc9e7afadc626b3ea.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/77aa4151379fba8b42e829ba1a7a6a57ac9d1606f8e97dec0351141ae7ec3f81.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1d851ddcf53c02d3e9056d7f30944dcfd9bb34e0831e7c1906e96d88672c7baf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/73daf998e21ec55bc223841ff7fdef2b4819f55a2f8b6ba30021d1ccc4e3b431.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4c55b7b25fafdb49ee63fb392decb8d70dcbfff32f42bcc0153280f9af4b3b89.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/efbbfe94a29af0079af08c9d1b08303b7b0eb80ebf55e33db7c2b67ff04ab820.jpg"],"titleId":"01008fe00e98e000","dlc":[]}